          "items": [
            "JUST REMODELED! | GREAT GULF VIEWS | LARGE PRIVATE POOL | PRIVATE HOME ON 30A WITH GUEST HOUSE | UNDER 2 MIN WALK TO BEACH | WALK TO GOLF COURSE & GULF PLACE | FLEXIBLE SCHEDULE*<br><br>*Avoid weekend traffic and busy check-in days with flexible scheduling! Only a 4 night minimum for most seasons! Saturday check-outs not permitted during March-August & October.<br> <br>| HOME FEATURES |<br>∘ Beach: 1.5 min walk to (2) public beach access \"Lake Causeway\" and \"Palms of Dune Allen West\" (Twice the size and the same distance from the home)<br>∘ 4500 sq ft total / 3200 sq ft cooled / 645 sq ft balconies/patio<br>∘ 7 Bedrooms / 6 Bathrooms<br> *4 BR Main House / 3 BR Guest House<br>∘ BRAND NEW Guest House<br>∘ Sleeps 22 (adults/children)<br>∘ Bikes: 4 Swell Bikes<br>∘ Private pool (Large 13' x 26')<br> *Pool may be heated for a fee<br>∘ Gulf views<br>∘ Xbox 360 gaming system<br>∘ 10 LCD TVs, equipped with Netflix and Pandora<br>∘ Spa-quality soaps<br>∘ Resort-style striped sheets & towels<br>∘ Parking for 6-7 vehicles (driveway and garage)<br><br>COMPLIMENTARY movie & music library through Netflix / Pandora<br>COMPLIMENTARY wine gift upon arrival<br> <br> <br>| 1ST FLOOR - MAIN HOUSE | sleeps 8<br>∘ PRIVATE POOL surrounded by privacy wall, outdoor dining, WEBER gas grill<br>∘ BEDROOM / GAME ROOM with 2 Full/Full bunk beds, flat screen TV, Xbox 360, full bathroom, and a wet bar [sleeps 8]<br>∘ GARAGE with room for 1 vehicle, total parking for 6-7<br> <br>| 1ST FLOOR - GUEST HOUSE | sleeps 8 <br>∘ KITCHEN that is fully stocked<br>∘ DINING AREA with seating for 7<br>∘ LIVING ROOM with a flat screen Smart TV<br>∘ PATIO that is covered, ceiling fans, outdoor dining<br>∘ KING SUITE BEDROOM with King bed, private bath, flat screen TV [sleeps 2]<br>∘ BEDROOM with Queen bed, flat screen TV [sleeps 2]<br>∘ BEDROOM with Full/Full bunk bed with individual TVs [sleeps 4]<br>∘ BATHROOM that is shared with 2 bedrooms<br>∘ LAUNDRY CLOSET with washer & dryer, access to the pool<br> <br>| 2ND FLOOR - MAIN HOUSE | sleeps 2<br>∘ KITCHEN that is fully stocked for cooking<br>∘ DINING that seats 13 at table & bar<br>∘ LIVING ROOM with a flat screen TV and ocean view balcony<br>∘ BEDROOM with Queen bed, flat screen TV, pool view balcony [sleeps 2]<br>∘ BATHROOM with tub/shower<br>∘ LAUNDRY ROOM with washer & dryer<br> <br>| 3RD FLOOR - MAIN HOUSE | sleeps 4<br>∘ KING SUITE BEDROOM with a King bed, full bath, flat screen TV, and ocean view balcony [sleeps 2]<br>∘ KING SUITE BEDROOM with a King bed, full bath, flat screen TV, and pool view balcony [sleeps 2]<br><br>*Furniture / decor at the home and nearby developments are always changing. The photos may vary from how the house is presently staged.<br>*Student/college groups are not permitted. Due to restrictions by HOA, insurance and/or local ordinances, we are unable to rent to guests under the age of 25. ID's will be checked by security staff and they have the right to refuse entry as well as evict guests found to be underage. For every 4 underaged guests, they must be accompanied by 1 parent at all times. A full guest list is required at the time of booking and the primary renter must be present at check-in and during the remainder of the reservation - this will be checked upon arrival and throughout the stay.<br>*A form of damage protection is required with all reservations: You may opt for the accidental damage protection that is already included in the quote or the $2,000 refundable security deposit. Only one is required. See the rental agreement for full details.<br>*Please enter exact dates and occupancy to see the most accurate rate. The rental price is subject to change based on season, holidays and other factors. Changes to the reservation may cause the rate to change.<br>*VRBO guests who cancel 60+ days prior to arrival will receive a full refund less a $300 cancellation fee. Losses upon cancellation may be avoided if you purchased a Travel Protection policy and the reason for cancellation is covered under those terms and conditions.<br><br>5080 W Co Hwy 30a - Santa Rosa Beach, FL (Dune Allen Beach - 30a)",
