    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Kay B.",
        "date": "2025-09-22T22:06:29Z",
        "id": "68d21c4ca49a391c6d558d38",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This is an amazing and beautiful place. We spent a wonderful time with family and friends. Every thing was perfect. Footprints was spectacular as beautiful as the pictures in the advertisement. It had everything we wanted and more. Wishing we could stay and continue building a life time of memories.",
        "title": "Life long memories"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dawn W.",
        "date": "2025-05-31T19:02:34Z",
        "id": "683bd016766b1674ca5acb9d",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Footprints in the sand was perfect for our family. We enjoyed the house and pool for sure! It was so nice having the beach so close by.",
        "title": "Perfect for our family!"
      },
      {
        "author": "Matt G.",
        "date": "2025-10-20T17:21:50Z",
        "id": "68f7066e7d7d58154aebb756",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Stayed in the Fall, and loved the outdoor area between the two houses! The tablet that was set up to stream music on the outdoor speakers was a nice touch that added to the experience of hanging by the pool. Relaxing around the fire pit nightly was an excellent bonus that we haven't experienced on 30A before. The guest house having its own kitchen and laundry machine is another unique touch that sets this property apart from so many others that our large families have stayed at. The garage was fully stocked with so many bikes, beach chairs, pool floats, sand toys, baby gate, stroller. Diamond Gulf was easy to work with and stayed in touch, checking in on our needs throughout our stay. All of this plus a short easy walk to the beach, make this a property that I would highly recommend!",
        "title": "Great for multiple families"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kenny L.",
        "date": "2022-07-09T04:28:23Z",
        "id": "62c903e7f44f7b30afe3c27b",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our second time here. Great location, clean, perfect! Already planning our next trip!",
        "title": "Great stay!"
      },
      {
